            "text": "Two cities moved in opposite directions on concealed carry this week.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "Portland ended the license-holder exemption in city meeting buildings; DOJ gave Glendale, California, until Nov. 4 to drop carry-permit costs reported at about $2,000. Both are headline-only so far: the ordinance and the DOJ letter were not read.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
